<p>The site must be left spotless, with no residual packing materials obstructing pathways or creating trip hazards. This rapid cleanup ensures that the space is immediately operational and aesthetically pleasing, reflecting the efficiency of the overall relocation project. Adherence to this protocol minimizes downtime and ensures a seamless transition to full operational status in Motihari.</p></div>
